  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <div class=\"form-group\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"form-group\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"result-group\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\">--</output>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"formulas\">\n      <p><strong>C → F:</strong> x × 9/5 + 32</p>\n      <p><strong>F → C:</strong> (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2a2d4a;\n  --text: #e0e0e0;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --accent-hover: #ffe08a;\n  --accent-pressed: #e6b85a;\n  --border: #4a4d6a;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.form-group {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\ninput, select {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 14px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transition: background 0.1s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  background: var(--accent-pressed);\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.result-group {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\n#result {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.formulas {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--border);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 20px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "const tempInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n  if (raw === '') {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const x = Number(raw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(x)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const dir = directionSelect.value;\n  let result;\n  if (dir === 'c-to-f') {\n    result = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    result = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  resultOutput.textContent = result.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\n\ntempInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n    convert();\n  }\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nAn offline, pixel-styled temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Convert Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x × 9/5 + 32`\n- Convert Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x − 32) × 5/9`\n- Output formatted to exactly two decimals (no units)\n- Invalid or empty input shows `Error`\n- Keyboard accessible: press Enter in the input to convert\n- Responsive layout down to 360px\n- No external dependencies, imports, or network requests\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a numeric temperature.\n3. Select the conversion direction.\n4. Click **Convert** or press Enter.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – markup and structure\n- `styles.css` – pixel-themed styling\n- `app.js` – conversion logic\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
